title: Denial Intelligence › Written appeal › Record the payer's decision
route: /denials?id=D-3279
intro: Once the payer answers a filed appeal, the person records what it decided. 'Overturned' and 'Partly overturned' close the denial. 'Upheld' goes on to the next appeal level, with a new deadline, or to accepting the denial.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: nobody plays the payer's reply, so the person records it here. In production Navigator saves the answer it finds in its daily check. The ladder is Appeal, Second-level appeal, External review.
---
start s1 "A filed appeal is on screen\nNext-step block 'Appeal filed. Waiting on the payer'"
click c1 "Click 'Record the payer's decision'"
overlay o1 "Modal 'Record the payer's decision'\nD-3279 · Beacon PPO"
input i1 "Pick one (radio cards)\n'Overturned' (chosen at first), 'Partly overturned' or 'Upheld'"
input i2 "Note (optional)\n'What the payer wrote, or who you spoke to.'"
click c2 "Click 'Cancel', the X, press Esc, or click the dimmed area"
endx e1 "Nothing is recorded\nThe appeal stays filed"
decision d1 "Which decision?"

group gWin "Overturned or partly overturned"
  click c3 "Click 'Record the decision'"
  store st1 "Decision saved on the denial: result, note, time\nHistory: 'You recorded the payer's decision: overturned' with the note, then 'Beacon overturned the denial on the appeal'\nThe scheduled daily check is dropped"
  store st2 "Request settled: leaves 'Appeal or call' (Dashboard stage 'Decided today')\nChip 'Overturned' or 'Partly overturned'\nLedger result approved or partly approved"
  agent a1 "Cadence updates the ledger and books the next review"
  toast t1 "'Overturned' or 'Partly overturned'\n'The ledger is updated and the next review is booked.'"
  screen sc1 "Block 'Overturned on appeal' or 'Partly overturned on appeal'\nYour note, or 'The ledger is updated and the next review is booked.'\nBadge goes down by one\nDenial moves to 'Closed' in the open denials list"
  end e2 "Denial is closed with the appeal's result"
endgroup

group gUp "Upheld"
  screen u1 "'Next step' appears under the cards"
  input u2 "Pick one\n'Appeal to the next level: Second-level appeal' (chosen at first)\nor 'Accept the denial'"
  process u3 "Next level shows its new deadline and window\nSecond-level appeal: 60 days to file\nExternal review: 120 days to file"
  process u4 "External review is the last level\nOnly 'Accept the denial' is offered"
  click c4 "Click 'Record and start the second-level appeal'"
  store st3 "Decision saved with the next level\nHistory: 'You recorded the payer's decision: upheld', 'Beacon upheld its decision on the appeal'"
  store st4 "Chip 'Appeal drafting', clock 'to file' with the new deadline\nThe filed letter and the old draft are cleared\nRung on the ladder moves up by one"
  agent a2 "Advocate starts the next-level letter"
  overlay o2 "Appeal drawer opens at once and drafts the letter"
  input u5 "'Reason for the record' (required)\nShows when 'Accept the denial' is picked"
  click c5 "Click 'Record and accept the denial'"
  store st5 "Decision saved: upheld, no next level"
endgroup

store r1 "Every decision is also logged for other screens\nDenial, request, payer, result and next level\nAnalytics reads the appeal rulings"
click c6 "Click 'See on the Dashboard'"

goto g1 "Continues in: Dashboard › Request drawer › Open and read a request"
goto g2 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Written appeal › Confirm and draft"
goto g3 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Accept the denial"

s1 --> c1 --> o1
o1 --> i1 & i2
o1 --> c2 --> e1
i1 --> d1
i2 --> d1
d1 -->|Overturned or Partly overturned| c3 --> st1 --> r1
st1 --> st2 --> a1 --> t1 --> sc1 --> e2
sc1 --> c6 --> g1
d1 -->|Upheld| u1 --> u2
u2 --> u3 --> c4 --> st3 --> r1
st3 --> st4 --> a2 --> o2 --> g2
u2 --> u4
u2 --> u5 --> c5 --> st5 --> r1
st5 --> g3
